title: SkylerClue0
---
Skyler: Theo punched me in the face!! He walked right up to me and punched me, in! The! Face! I was only fighting back in self-defense. He shouldn’t be allowed to be the lead. I demand you remove him and recast at once. #line:skyler_drama_club_C00
===

title: SkylerClue1
---
Skyler: My mom is on the PTA! She helps out in the drama club too and does all our makeup. Isn’t that cool? You wouldn’t want to expel the kid of one of your most generous volunteers, would you? #line:skyler_drama_club_C01
===

title: SkylerClue2
---
Skyler: I can explain this, it’s just for the show. In fact, I can do your makeup for you! I know how to do a great smoky eye! I’ve got plenty of colors, look! #line:skyler_drama_club_C02
===


title: TheoClue0
---
Theo: Skyler came out of nowhere and punched me in the face. He already had a black eye when he punched me, swear on my life, I don’t know how he got it. I didn’t lay a hand on him. #line:theo_drama_club_C00
===

title: TheoClue1
---
Theo: I’ve been taking voice lessons! I used to be too nervous to sing in front of people, but I’ve really worked on my confidence and I think it’s paying off. I need to take good care of my vocal chords. Did you know honey helps soothe inflammation? #line:theo_drama_club_C01
===

title: TheoClue2
---
Theo: I got the lead in the the play! I know Skyler usually gets the lead, but this time it’s finally my turn. #line:theo_drama_club_C02
===


title: DramaClubSuccess
---
Theo: I’m glad you didn’t fall for his acting, Principal Judge. I better get back to the rehearsal. You’ll come see the show, right? Oh, by the way… I don’t mean to be a tattletale, but the day before Pork Pie went missing, I saw Skyler lurking around the corridor where Pork Pie’s storage room is. He sure spent a lot of time pacing back and forth, and even tested out the doorknob of the room. Do you think he might have taken poor Pork Pie? #line:drama_club_success
<<next_case GameManager>>
===

title: DramaClubFailure
---
Superintendent: Bad call, Judge. A kid in the drama club just dropped the act and admitted they saw Skyler applying makeup to fake a black eye before attacking Theo! He thought getting Theo suspended might give him another shot at the star role. You fell for it and caught the wrong kid! Don’t make me recast your role as Principal… #line:drama_club_failure
<<next_case GameManager>>
===